      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……なんなの、あの男。\r\n口ばっかりで頼りにならないわね。",
        "official_en": "...What a pathetic excuse for a man. All talk, but never follows through with his words.",
        "real_en": "...What's with that man? All talk, and no help at all."
      },
