      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ねえ、ニコル。\r\n気づかない？\r\nこの場所、ドール湖に似てるでしょ？",
        "official_en": "Say, Nichol. Haven’t you noticed how this place looks like Lake Dorr?",
        "real_en": null
