      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はあ？\r\n催眠魔法ってなんの話？\r\nそんなことより劫火はどうしたのよ。",
        "official_en": "What? Hypnotized? What in the blazes are you on about?\r\nNever mind that. What have you done to Ignis?",
        "real_en": "Huh? What are you talking about, hypnosis? More importantly, what happened to Inferno Veritas?"
      },
