      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水の守り人の死に場所にはピッタリってことよ！\r\nあの世で弟と会うといいわ！",
        "official_en": "This is the perfect spot for a Warden to die! You’ll be joining your brother in the next life before long!",
        "real_en": "This is the perfect place for a Warden of Water to die! You can see your younger brother in the afterlife!"
